@startuml
title Motor control simulation components

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

component "Demo scenario" as Scenario
component "Simulated HAL" as HAL
component "PI motor controller" as Controller
component "First order motor model" as Motor

Scenario -> HAL : target speed and enable
HAL -> Controller : ADC values and GPIO state
Controller -> HAL : PWM duty and fault state
HAL -> Motor : PWM duty
Motor -> HAL : measured speed

note bottom of HAL
  The simulated HAL can later be
  replaced by hardware drivers.
end note

@enduml
